// Dawn. Every choice leads here in the end. When it's over, the game goes back to the title screen.

# dawn
@chara-hide-all time=500ms
@mask time=1s
@bg hill_morning.webp
@wait 800ms
@mask-off time=1500ms
@window show time=300ms
Before I knew it, the edge of the sky had begun to turn pale.
The countless stars faded one by one, and a morning mist settled over the hill.
@chara Akari normal at=center time=400ms
Akari "So the night really does end."
@chara Akari normal at=left time=300ms
@chara Sou smile at=right time=400ms
Sou "It does. Every single night. {br}That's why waiting isn't so bad."
@chara Akari smile at=left
Akari "I'll come again. Earlier next time."
@se chime.wav
As I started down the slope, the bell on the door rang behind me, just once more.
@chara-hide-all time=1s
Waiting for Stars: The End
@window hide time=300ms
@mask time=2s
@wait 1s
